Doc Miles, played by Dwight Yoakam.

10
00:51:45,882 --> 00:51:51,882
Carlito, played by Carlos Sanz.

11
00:56:56,470 --> 00:57:02,470
Crank is a 2006 American action film directed by Mark Neveldine
and Brian Taylor (in their directorial debut).

12
01:02:07,058 --> 01:02:13,058
It stars Jason Statham, Amy Smart, Jose Pablo
Cantillo, Efren Ramirez and Dwight Yoakam.

13
01:07:17,647 --> 01:07:23,647
In the film, Chev Chelios (Statham), an LA–based British assassin, is poisoned by a synthetic drug and must keep his adrenaline
flowing constantly to keep himself alive, while trying to track down the culprits responsible for poisoning him.

14
01:12:28,235 --> 01:12:34,235
It was followed by a sequel titled Crank: High Voltage.

15
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
The film explores themes of assassin, helicopter, hitman, poison, fistfight.

16
01:22:49,411 --> 01:22:55,411
The tone is intense.
